      "statement": "Outbox row claiming uses FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED with a NOT EXISTS subquery that prevents two drains from holding the same aggregate simultaneously, and a transaction-scoped pg_advisory_xact_lock serialises claim snapshots; dead-drain rows become re-claimable after the lease expires (default 120s).",
