    {
      "id": "claim_0c1805c947614174b30a280e7e39009b",
      "statement": "coalesceOutboxEvents folds a batch of events into one intent per aggregate where the last event by sequence wins: a delete after upserts cancels the upserts, several upserts collapse to one write, and an upsert after a delete re-creates the document.",
      "evidence": [
        {
