    {
      "id": "claim_78bcfb5db1c844759862a9cbd021059a",
      "statement": "ManticoreSearchEngine.applyBatch chunks bulk lines under MANTICORE_BULK_MAX_BYTES (8MB); on a chunk failure it isolates the failing line by re-sending the owning mutation alone then re-sending the rest, capped at MANTICORE_BULK_ISOLATION_RESENDS_PER_CHUNK per chunk; unisolatable entries are released unblamed and later chunks are not sent.",
