      "id": "claim_dc4d2a56a633450e9c44b337b83f058e",
      "statement": "The search index is physically split into two RT tables: active (placeable stock, default scope) and archive (closed/stale/expired); a document is in exactly one partition at a time determined by status, sluitingsdatum passage, and optionally a recency window; the projectionHash is prefixed with the partition so a partition move changes the hash and is never skipped as unchanged.",
