      "id": "claim_8b8646ea72654211ad1d7513a3148efd",
      "statement": "SearchAdapter.search parses the Boolean query via @ji/domain (cached in a process-local LRU), normalises filters (default scope title), canonicalises and hashes the AST using codepoint-order comparison (not localeCompare, which would vary by ICU locale and cause silent cross-process cache misses on a shared Redis key), reads the applied version, checks the result cache, singleflights concurrent identical uncached requests, executes the engine search, and caches the result and facets with a 120s TTL; incomplete results are never cached.",
